{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/凛耀•疾风刻痕","pageid":9054,"revid":22163,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E7%96%BE%E9%A3%8E%E5%88%BB%E7%97%95&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E7%96%BE%E9%A3%8E%E5%88%BB%E7%97%95&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E7%96%BE%E9%A3%8E%E5%88%BB%E7%97%95&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>凛耀•疾风刻痕</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.87.9B.E8.80.80.E2.80.A2.E7.96.BE.E9.A3.8E.E5.88.BB.E7.97.95\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"凛耀•疾风刻痕\"><b>凛耀•疾风刻痕</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 凛耀•疾风刻痕.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/19/8kzgqc8jn4hf04z4otgt7voujm6kaga.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E7%96%BE%E9%A3%8E%E5%88%BB%E7%97%95.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/19/8kzgqc8jn4hf04z4otgt7voujm6kaga.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%87%9B%E8%80%80%E2%80%A2%E7%96%BE%E9%A3%8E%E5%88%BB%E7%97%95.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/19/8kzgqc8jn4hf04z4otgt7voujm6kaga.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />凛耀•疾风刻痕\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>1\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>范围攻击、对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-5十字\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓1-↑1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>1*5\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）选择十字范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>格内任一地形格，进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冲锋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冲锋</font></span></span>]。随后强制选中最近敌人（目标十字范围5格内），对其直线<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">80%</font>范围伤害。<br />✦若强制选中的目标已有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"剑痕\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">剑痕</font></span></span>]，则攻击范围改为：该目标横排<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>格，且以自身面向，触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"个性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">个性</font></span></span>]中施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"剑痕\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">剑痕</font></span></span>]的效果。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]，效果：释放非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]技能或普攻前，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>，效果持续至行动结束。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-5十字 1*5.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c9/4odyegq1h7fhcxsd6xjcrd8ngrhs585.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_1%2A5.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"82\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c9/4odyegq1h7fhcxsd6xjcrd8ngrhs585.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_1%2A5.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c9/4odyegq1h7fhcxsd6xjcrd8ngrhs585.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-5%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_1%2A5.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"195\" data-file-height=\"201\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" 